---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Roof Leak Repair Wake Forest NC | Fast Leak Fixes" description="Professional roof leak repair in Wake Forest, NC. We find the source and fix it right — flashing, valleys, penetrations, and shingles. Free estimates.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → <a href="/#services">Services</a> → Roof Leak Repair</div>
      <h1>Roof Leak Repair</h1>
      <p>Locate the source fast and seal it properly so your Wake Forest home stays dry.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>Accurate Diagnosis, Lasting Fix</h2>
      <p>Roof leaks often start far from the stain you see on the ceiling. We inspect the full system — shingles, flashing around chimneys and vents, valleys, skylights, and underlayment — to find the true entry point.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Full diagnostic inspection with photos</li>
        <li>Written estimate before any work</li>
        <li>Same-visit repairs when materials are on the truck</li>
        <li>Honest advice if a larger section or full replacement is the better long-term solution</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Common Leak Sources in Wake Forest</h2>
      <p>Aging asphalt shingles, failed pipe boots, step flashing, ridge vents, and poor previous repairs. Our crews know the typical failure points on homes in Heritage, Traditions, and older Wake Forest neighborhoods.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
